.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
uv.lock

# The comment corpus is large (tens of MB per full harvest) and is rewritten
# wholesale on every re-harvest, so committing it would grow the repo without
# bound. It is a local working set: regenerate with
#   uv run scripts/harvest_reddit.py --skip-posts
# Evidence does not depend on it — every quote a record rests on is copied into
# that record's `evidence[].quote`, and dist/candidates.csv carries the
# verbatim excerpt and permalink for every ranked candidate.
harvest/**/comments.jsonl
